{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>תועה</b> Three times in the Masorah: חמורו תועה. והנה תועה בשדה. אדם תועה מדרך השכל. This is what they said: one found a cow grazing — this is not lost property; one found a donkey with its gear inverted — this is lost property. This is חמורו תועה — it is straying in a field and departing from the way."], :book :exodus, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 23, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:14:08.323149033Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}